  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Tens and hundreds",
   "texto": [
    "To form 11-19, di **on** (ten) and then the unit: **on bir** (11), **on iki** (12), **on dokuz** (19).",
    "The tens are their own words: **yirmi, otuz, kırk, elli, altmış, yetmiş, seksen, doksan**. They are combined without «y»: **kırk iki** (42).",
    "**Yüz** means 100; **iki yüz** = 200."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Plural and quantity",
   "texto": [
    "The plural suffix is **-lar/-ler**: **kitaplar** (books), **evler** (houses). The vowel changes to harmony.",
    "After a number, the name is usually left in singular: **üç kitap** = three books, no * üç kitaplar *."
   ]
  },
